# LoveHub — Cursor Rules (Fable 5 Optimized)

## PROJECT INFO
- Flutter Android App, package: `com.example.lovehub`
- Clean Architecture: Presentation → Domain → Data
- State: Riverpod ^2.5.1 | Navigation: go_router | Min SDK: 26
- Firebase Spark plan (FREE — không dùng Cloud Functions vì cần Blaze)

---

## FOLDER STRUCTURE
```
lib/
├── core/                    # Shared: errors, utils, constants
├── config/                  # Routes, theme, router
├── features/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── domain/entities/ # AuthEntity
│   │   ├── data/repositories/
│   │   └── presentation/screens/, providers/
│   ├── couple/
│   ├── streak/
│   ├── pet/
│   ├── memory/
│   ├── mood/
│   ├── saving_jar/
│   ├── ai_chat/
│   └── settings/
├── services/                # Cloudinary, OneSignal push, Groq AI
└── main.dart
```

---

## CODING RULES

### Widgets
- Default: `StatelessWidget` + `ConsumerWidget` (Riverpod)
- `StatefulWidget` CHỈ khi cần AnimationController, TextEditingController, FocusNode
- Luôn dùng `const` constructor
- Widget > 50 lines → extract ra file riêng
- KHÔNG đặt business logic, Firebase calls trong `build()`

### Providers (Riverpod)
- Đặt trong `features/{feature}/presentation/providers/`
- Naming: `{feature}{Type}Provider` → `streakStreamProvider`, `petStateProvider`
- `StreamProvider` cho Firestore real-time data
- `StateNotifierProvider` cho complex mutable state
- LUÔN handle AsyncValue: `.when(data:, loading:, error:)`

### Architecture
- Repository interface → `domain/`
- Repository implementation → `data/`
- UseCase: 1 class, 1 method `call()`
- Entity: immutable, KHÔNG có Firebase dependency
- Layer: Presentation→Domain OK, Data→Domain OK, KHÔNG ngược

### Naming
- Files: `snake_case` (e.g., `streak_repository.dart`)
- Classes: `PascalCase` (e.g., `StreakRepository`)
- Variables/methods: `camelCase` (e.g., `currentStreak`)
- Constants: `SCREAMING_SNAKE` (e.g., `MAX_RECOVERY_TOKENS = 4`)
- Private: `_underscore` prefix

---

## FIREBASE RULES

### Firestore
- Luôn handle Stream errors: `.handleError()`
- Enable offline persistence trong `main.dart` (1 lần duy nhất)
- Nhiều document liên quan → `.runTransaction()`
- Nhiều document độc lập → `.batch()`
- KHÔNG `.get()` trong loop → dùng `.where().get()` hoặc batch reads
- Check Security Rules compatibility khi viết query mới

### Security Rules
- KHÔNG: `allow read, write: if true`
- Mọi rule phải có `request.auth != null`
- Couple data chỉ 2 thành viên được đọc/ghi

### Structure
```
/users/{uid}
/couples/{coupleId}
/streaks/{coupleId}
/pets/{coupleId}
/memories/{coupleId}
/moods/{coupleId}
/savingJars/{coupleId}
/aiUsage/{coupleId}
```

---

## EXTERNAL SERVICES (KHÔNG hardcode trong code)

| Service | Used For | Config Location |
|---------|----------|-----------------|
| Firebase Auth/Firestore | Auth, database | `firebase_options.dart` (generated) |
| Groq API | AI Chat (thay Gemini) | `lib/config/api_config.dart` |
| Cloudinary | Memory photos | `lib/config/api_config.dart` (cloud_name, unsigned preset) |
| OneSignal | Push notification | `lib/config/api_config.dart` (App ID, REST Key) |
| Cloudflare Worker | Push relay (bypass CORS) | URL trong push service |

### Groq API
- REST direct call (OpenAI-compatible)
- Model: auto-fallback qua danh sách
- Context-aware: tên 2 người, ngày yêu, streak, mood, pet, saving jar
- Giới hạn: 20 câu/ngày cho cả cặp (đếm trong `aiUsage/{coupleId}`)

### OneSignal Push
- External ID = Firebase UID
- Cloudflare Worker relay: `https://lovehub-push.lehuuluan00.workers.dev`
- Trigger: check-in, mood change, memory added, pet fed

### Cloudinary
- Cloud name: `df3jqgrvk`
- Unsigned upload preset: `lovehub_unsigned`

---

## ANDROID NATIVE

### Home Screen Widget
- Kotlin code: `android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/lovehub/`
- Update: WorkManager (15 phút minimum)
- Constraints: `networkType = NOT_REQUIRED`, `requiresBatteryNotLow = true`

### Foreground Service
- Thông báo thường trú (toggle on/off)
- Cần notification channel + icon + title + text

### AlarmManager
- Milestone reminders
- Persist qua device restart: `BOOT_COMPLETED` receiver

---

## ANIMATIONS

| Type | Use Case | Implementation |
|------|----------|----------------|
| Rive | Pet (Cat, Habit Cat, Muza) | State machine: idle/happy/sad/levelup |
| Lottie | Confetti, streak vỡ, loading, celebration | `LottieBuilder.asset()` |
| flutter_animate | Micro: button press, card appear | `.animate().fadeIn().slideY()` |

- Pet Rive files: `assets/animations/`
- Lottie JSON: `assets/animations/`
- KHÔNG dùng flutter_animate cho pet

---

## BUSINESS LOGIC (DON'T CHANGE)

### Streak
- Max recovery tokens: 4
- Token earn: 15 ngày liên tiếp → +1 token (counter reset mỗi lần nhận)
- Streak break window: 48h để dùng token
- Check-in deadline: 23:59
- At-risk warning: 21:00 nếu chưa check-in

### Pet
- Max HP: 100 | Max Level: 10
- HP decay: 5 HP/ngày không check-in
- Feed: 20 LP → +30 HP
- Level up: level × 100 LP cần

### Love Points
- Check-in: +10 | Diary: +20 | Mood: +5
- Both positive mood bonus: +15
- 7-day streak bonus: +50
- Weekly mission: +30

